  INDEX `IDX_QRTZ_T_NFT_ST_MISFIRE_GRP`(`SCHED_NAME` ASC, `MISFIRE_INSTR` ASC, `NEXT_FIRE_TIME` ASC, `TRIGGER_GROUP` ASC, `TRIGGER_STATE` ASC) USING BTREE,
